/4KPuLFlBYa0AMivkyzlxrJ74eSG.jpg"},{"id":2495799,"name":"Denis Shlenkov","role":"Politseyskiy"},{"id":2495800,"name":"Marina Straton","role":"Anna Berezina"},{"id":1484477,"name":"Dmitri Polonsky","role":"Voiceover","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dmIJquXH8a7DS0ZgnqGV5BObeOp.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Ninth - La nona vittima","overview":"Nella San Pietroburgo del XIX secolo, la famosa chiaroveggente Olivia Reed esegue sedute magiche e spiritiche che le fanno guadagnare l'attenzione, oltre che delle persone comuni, del colonnello Rostov. L'ufficiale di polizia, nel frattempo, indaga anche su una serie di brutali omicidi che stanno sconvolgendo la città e che sembrano connessi a rituali di magia nera. Otto giovani donne hanno già perso la vita per mano di un serial killer che opera in modi simili a quelli raccontanti in un suo romanzo da Jack, padre di Olivia e famoso scrittore.","tagline":"The Ninth - La nona vittima"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Ninth","overview":"Petersburg at the end of the 19th century was embraced by a massive enthusiasm for the occult sciences and esotericism. British medium Olivia Reed arrives in the capital of the Russian Empire on tour and gathers crowds of people at her public spiritualistic sessions. At this time, a series of ritual mysterious murders takes place in the city. Girls are abducted on the streets, their mutilated bodies are found in various parts of the city. The investigation is carried out by a young police officer Rostov and his assistant Ganin. With each new victim, things are becoming more confused. Suspicion leads Rostov to Olivia, and he decides to turn to her in the hope that her genuine or imaginary ability to summon the spirits of the dead can help to get on the trail of the killer."},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Петербург конца XIX века охвачен массовым увлечением оккультными науками и эзотерикой. Британка-медиум Оливия Рид приезжает в столицу Российской империи с гастролями и собирает на своих публичных спиритических сеансах толпы людей. В это время в городе происходит серия ритуальных загадочных убийств. На улицах похищают девушек, их изувеченные тела находят в самых разных концах города. Расследованием занимаются молодой полицейский офицер Ростов и его помощник Ганин. С каждой новой жертвой дело становится все запутаннее. Подозрение приводит Ростова к Оливии, и он решает обратиться к ней в надежде, что ее подлинная или мнимая способность вызывать духов погибших может помочь выйти на след убийцы.","tagline":"«Открой тайну её числа»"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5s6BfQcLhf4KlqKT5CFY9SJrUpr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/odb22pd53XAdk1FvDNKFl0NqKF9.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":577028,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5s6BfQcLhf4KlqKT5CFY9SJrUpr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5s6BfQcLhf4KlqKT5CFY9SJrUpr.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5s6BfQcLhf4KlqKT5CFY9SJrUpr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5s6BfQcLhf4KlqKT5CFY9SJrUpr.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2Q9kkzkI5LGqP9K7ymmOc9CNRE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o2Q9kkzkI5LGqP9K7ymmOc9CNRE.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2Q9kkzkI5LGqP9K7ymmOc9CNRE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o2Q9kkzkI5LGqP9K7ymmOc9CNRE.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"ru":{"sta